+## Deploy
+
+`npm run build` outputs a static site to `./dist/`. To deploy it on Wasmer Edge, [import this repository](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=incluud%2Faccessible-astro-starter). The import does not create a copy in your GitHub account, so import your own fork to deploy your customized site.
